000182r 2  AD 02 0C         lda facing
000185r 2  0A               asl a
000186r 2  18               clc
000187r 2  69 08            adc #8
000189r 2  18               clc
00018Ar 2  6D 05 0C         adc walk_phase
00018Dr 2  8D 10 0C         sta frame_id
