001109r 1               .include "game/proximity.s"
001109r 2               ; Apple target adaptation, not a claim of original Oric collision equivalence.
001109r 2               ; Retain the source semantic grid, sample proposed feet rather than a broad
001109r 2               ; 4/5-cell look-ahead. Five-row motion uses nearest 140/160/180 depth bands.
001109r 2               .segment "LOWCODE"
