00010Er 2               ; Perspective floor corridor. Without this, narrowing the source probes can
00010Er 2               ; slip through gaps between its isolated wall sentinels. Side-door lanes begin
00010Er 2               ; at y=175; elsewhere keep the proposed feet inside the shared wall geometry.
00010Er 2               full_floor_envelope:
