0011AAr 2  8D 0D C0         sta $C00D              ; 80-column mixed text / DHGR hardware
0011ADr 2  8D 0E C0         sta $C00E
0011B0r 2  2C 51 C0         bit $C051
0011B3r 2  2C 54 C0         bit $C054
0011B6r 2  2C 57 C0         bit $C057
